1
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:40,070
[River of No Return]

2
00:01:40,100 --> 00:01:43,020
[Episode 18: Tie Fuyuan]

3
00:01:43,509 --> 00:01:44,310
Rectifier Yu,

4
00:01:45,539 --> 00:01:46,539
you can't stop me

5
00:01:47,250 --> 00:01:48,910
from doing what I've decided.

6
00:01:53,380 --> 00:01:55,440
Your Highness, forgive my boldness,

7
00:01:56,550 --> 00:01:57,650
but I beg you to think of

8
00:01:57,650 --> 00:01:59,950
Her Majesty the Empress.

9
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:04,760
His Majesty's life is in danger now,

10
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:07,010
and she doesn't know
whether you're still alive.

11
00:02:07,010 --> 00:02:10,870
Her Majesty is already struggling
to hold things together on her own.

12
00:02:12,260 --> 00:02:13,860
If ill-intentioned people sow discord

13
00:02:13,860 --> 00:02:16,160
and seize the opportunity
to stir up trouble,

14
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:18,960
and the court and the public
believe their lies...

15
00:02:20,870 --> 00:02:22,530
Your Highness, don't forget.

16
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:25,350
We haven't received

17
00:02:25,350 --> 00:02:27,350
any word from Beijing in a long time.

18
00:02:38,380 --> 00:02:39,100
Tingyi.

19
00:02:39,540 --> 00:02:40,670
Yes, Your Highness.

20
00:02:40,820 --> 00:02:42,020
Do you know why Father

21
00:02:43,250 --> 00:02:44,730
sent me south?

22
00:02:45,540 --> 00:02:48,400
Because as long as Your Highness
stayed in Beijing,

23
00:02:49,480 --> 00:02:51,810
His Majesty could never move the capital.

24
00:02:55,750 --> 00:02:57,530
Father's decision to move the capital

25
00:02:57,530 --> 00:03:00,390
was made out of concern
for the people's tax burden.

26
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:04,020
But I opposed it

27
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:06,510
because I wanted to protect the people

28
00:03:06,510 --> 00:03:08,700
from the dangers it could bring.

29
00:03:12,040 --> 00:03:13,140
At this point,

30
00:03:17,480 --> 00:03:20,079
it's hard to say
who was right and who was wrong.

31
00:03:20,540 --> 00:03:21,400
Your Highness,

32
00:03:22,310 --> 00:03:24,240
there are many things in this world

33
00:03:24,820 --> 00:03:26,220
that we have no choice in.

34
00:03:26,980 --> 00:03:28,980
The common people are no exception,

35
00:03:29,410 --> 00:03:30,630
nor are rulers.

36
00:03:34,140 --> 00:03:35,070
Well said.

37
00:03:36,630 --> 00:03:37,920
No choice.

38
00:03:39,810 --> 00:03:41,470
But does having no choice mean

39
00:03:41,810 --> 00:03:44,870
you can stand by and do nothing
with a clear conscience?

40
00:03:55,750 --> 00:03:56,610
Your Highness.

41
00:03:58,790 --> 00:03:59,750
Tell me,

42
00:04:01,260 --> 00:04:03,390
what do you think of me as Crown Prince?

43
00:04:05,730 --> 00:04:07,140
I wouldn't presume to judge you.

44
00:04:07,140 --> 00:04:09,600
Your Highness
is the very foundation of the nation.

45
00:04:09,600 --> 00:04:11,910
There are things even you, Yu Qian,
don't dare say?

46
00:04:11,910 --> 00:04:12,910
In your eyes,

47
00:04:13,200 --> 00:04:15,260
I'm nothing but a scheming, ruthless,

48
00:04:15,260 --> 00:04:16,399
cold-blooded man

49
00:04:16,690 --> 00:04:18,519
with no compassion or sense of honor.

50
00:04:18,519 --> 00:04:19,190
Is that it?

51
00:04:20,630 --> 00:04:21,490
Your Highness!

52
00:04:23,250 --> 00:04:24,310
Then let me ask you.

53
00:04:26,570 --> 00:04:28,100
Fang Du is your best friend.

54
00:04:28,910 --> 00:04:30,020
If he dies,

55
00:04:30,890 --> 00:04:32,400
won't you be heartbroken?

56
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:39,530
Wu Dingyuan is our friend.

57
00:04:42,770 --> 00:04:45,100
I know what Your Highness
is trying to say.

58
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:47,820
And I know

59
00:04:47,820 --> 00:04:50,000
what you've been worried about all along.

60
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:52,530
But we both saw the Iron Alliance

61
00:04:52,640 --> 00:04:54,730
take Wu Dingyuan away that day.

62
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:56,260
And Jinan

63
00:04:56,820 --> 00:04:58,380
is where their lair is.

64
00:04:58,730 --> 00:05:00,320
Ever since Dongshuiguan Wharf,

65
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:02,260
Your Highness has escaped death
several times

66
00:05:02,260 --> 00:05:04,060
and barely made it out of their clutches.

67
00:05:04,060 --> 00:05:07,460
Are you really going to
walk straight into the lion's den now?

68
00:05:07,670 --> 00:05:09,530
I must remind you, Your Highness!

69
00:05:10,400 --> 00:05:13,260
Whatever kind of emperor
you wish to become one day,

70
00:05:13,260 --> 00:05:15,650
you must first take the throne.

71
00:05:16,030 --> 00:05:17,760
Given the situation we're in now,

72
00:05:17,760 --> 00:05:20,090
do you think we can afford
any more delays?

73
00:05:21,170 --> 00:05:22,580
Yes, I know

74
00:05:23,020 --> 00:05:24,550
it's unfair to Wu Dingyuan.

75
00:05:26,790 --> 00:05:28,090
But some things,

76
00:05:28,420 --> 00:05:29,280
Your Highness,

77
00:05:29,700 --> 00:05:31,650
simply cannot wait!

78
00:05:35,620 --> 00:05:36,330
I know

79
00:05:37,320 --> 00:05:38,760
Your Highness has always been

80
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:41,530
a good imperial grandson
and a good crown prince.

81
00:05:41,770 --> 00:05:43,230
I don't know what it takes

82
00:05:43,230 --> 00:05:45,409
to be a good emperor,

83
00:05:47,140 --> 00:05:49,050
but there's one thing I do know:

84
00:05:49,590 --> 00:05:51,250
an emperor must be impartial.

85
00:05:51,900 --> 00:05:54,580
He must put no one above the state,
put no private interests first,

86
00:05:54,580 --> 00:05:56,710
and let no personal feelings sway him.

87
00:06:09,850 --> 00:06:13,120
So an impartial emperor
can let others down without remorse?

88
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:14,370
Tingyi, don't forget.

89
00:06:14,370 --> 00:06:15,910
I'm not an emperor yet.

90
00:06:19,440 --> 00:06:20,210
Time to eat.

91
00:06:32,260 --> 00:06:33,720
I also think Your Highness

92
00:06:33,830 --> 00:06:35,830
doesn't need to rescue Wu Dingyuan.

93
00:06:41,909 --> 00:06:43,140
But I do think

94
00:06:43,970 --> 00:06:45,380
you should go to Jinan.

95
00:06:46,270 --> 00:06:47,780
What are you talking about?

96
00:06:47,780 --> 00:06:49,470
Lord Yu, don't you find it strange?

97
00:06:49,470 --> 00:06:51,550
In this conspiracy spanning two capitals,

98
00:06:51,550 --> 00:06:54,170
eliminating the Crown Prince
should have been their top priority.

99
00:06:54,170 --> 00:06:57,050
So why did the Iron Alliance
abandon their attempt

100
00:06:58,290 --> 00:06:59,750
and head to Jinan instead?

101
00:07:01,320 --> 00:07:03,050
They've changed their target.

102
00:07:05,500 --> 00:07:07,100
The Iron Alliance withdrew.

103
00:07:08,350 --> 00:07:09,880
That means the Prince of Han

104
00:07:10,230 --> 00:07:12,470
and that Young Master Suanni
plan to do it themselves.

105
00:07:12,470 --> 00:07:14,700
Those rebels know Your Highness plans

106
00:07:15,030 --> 00:07:16,260
to head north along the canal.

107
00:07:16,260 --> 00:07:18,210
They'll surely have a deadly trap

108
00:07:18,400 --> 00:07:19,860
waiting for us in Linqing.

109
00:07:20,210 --> 00:07:21,530
No, no, no, no.

110
00:07:21,880 --> 00:07:23,460
The northern stretch of the canal

111
00:07:23,460 --> 00:07:26,260
may already be crawling
with the usurper's spies.

112
00:07:27,530 --> 00:07:29,730
I've never studied military strategy,

113
00:07:30,380 --> 00:07:33,200
but even I know the key to victory
is catching the enemy off guard.

114
00:07:33,200 --> 00:07:35,730
If they expect us to meet them in Linqing,

115
00:07:36,020 --> 00:07:36,380
then...

116
00:07:36,380 --> 00:07:37,210
Su Jingxi,

117
00:07:38,820 --> 00:07:41,290
you're the one who advised His Highness
not to rescue Wu Dingyuan,

118
00:07:41,290 --> 00:07:43,360
and now
you're suggesting that he go to Jinan.

119
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:44,960
What exactly is your stance?

120
00:07:45,700 --> 00:07:46,460
Lord Yu.

121
00:07:46,840 --> 00:07:48,460
In medicine, we adapt our prescriptions

122
00:07:48,460 --> 00:07:50,409
to the patient's condition

123
00:07:50,620 --> 00:07:52,270
and adjust our treatment as needed.

124
00:07:52,270 --> 00:07:53,930
I suppose war is no different.

125
00:07:54,909 --> 00:07:56,170
Personally, all I want

126
00:07:56,210 --> 00:07:59,540
is for His Highness
to reach the capital as soon as possible.

127
00:08:00,020 --> 00:08:01,140
Enough. No more arguing.

128
00:08:01,140 --> 00:08:02,470
Sit down and let's talk.

129
00:08:09,050 --> 00:08:09,780
Lord Yu.

130
00:08:12,210 --> 00:08:14,470
Linqing is extremely dangerous right now.

131
00:08:14,470 --> 00:08:15,510
If we leave the canal

132
00:08:15,510 --> 00:08:17,040
and head straight to Jinan,

133
00:08:17,210 --> 00:08:19,460
we'll avoid the enemy's strongest forces.

134
00:08:19,460 --> 00:08:21,060
As for rescuing Wu Dingyuan,

135
00:08:21,230 --> 00:08:22,960
that'll just be an added bonus.

136
00:08:22,970 --> 00:08:24,820
Going to Jinan
may help us avoid the ambush,

137
00:08:24,820 --> 00:08:26,200
but it'll also cost us more time.

138
00:08:26,200 --> 00:08:28,330
If we can't get back to Beijing in time,

139
00:08:29,590 --> 00:08:31,050
it'll ruin the whole plan.

140
00:08:31,210 --> 00:08:33,539
I've already calculated the travel time.

141
00:08:34,770 --> 00:08:35,450
If we

142
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:38,770
leave Machang Lake today,
we can reach Jinan in time.

143
00:08:39,100 --> 00:08:40,700
After rescuing Wu Dingyuan,

144
00:08:41,049 --> 00:08:41,980
we'll ride north

145
00:08:42,289 --> 00:08:43,860
from Jinan on the 29th

146
00:08:44,260 --> 00:08:45,190
and reach Dezhou

147
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:46,410
on the 30th.

148
00:08:46,930 --> 00:08:48,530
From there,
we'll pass through Cangzhou to Tianjin,

149
00:08:48,530 --> 00:08:50,550
then take the White Canal to Tongzhou.

150
00:08:50,550 --> 00:08:51,910
We'll make it to the capital

151
00:08:51,910 --> 00:08:53,760
before the 3rd day of the 6th month.

152
00:08:53,760 --> 00:08:54,810
It'll just mean

153
00:08:56,070 --> 00:08:57,400
a more arduous journey.

154
00:08:58,690 --> 00:08:59,550
Your Highness,

155
00:09:00,880 --> 00:09:01,930
your schedule

156
00:09:02,980 --> 00:09:04,950
leaves absolutely no room for error.

157
00:09:04,950 --> 00:09:07,170
If anything delays us
or goes wrong along the way,

158
00:09:07,170 --> 00:09:08,930
we'll miss the deadline.

159
00:09:09,310 --> 00:09:11,710
Wouldn't going to Linqing risk delays too?

160
00:09:14,650 --> 00:09:15,340
Yu Qian.

161
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:17,890
You and I will separate now.

162
00:09:18,770 --> 00:09:19,790
Don't give me that response.

163
00:09:19,790 --> 00:09:20,650
Remember this.

164
00:09:20,980 --> 00:09:22,140
I'm heading to Jinan.

165
00:09:22,140 --> 00:09:23,140
Take a boat now

166
00:09:23,250 --> 00:09:25,150
and go straight to Beijing
to find my uncle.

167
00:09:25,150 --> 00:09:26,400
I don't know what the situation

168
00:09:26,400 --> 00:09:28,000
in Beijing is like right now,

169
00:09:28,270 --> 00:09:29,940
but the only person we can trust

170
00:09:29,940 --> 00:09:31,300
is my uncle.

171
00:09:33,220 --> 00:09:34,100
B-But...

172
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:35,360
No buts.

173
00:09:35,560 --> 00:09:36,890
They are looking for me.

174
00:09:37,450 --> 00:09:39,740
They have cast a wide net in Linqing.

175
00:09:40,290 --> 00:09:41,100
Don't worry.

176
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:43,280
I don't think they will hurt you.

177
00:09:56,020 --> 00:09:57,170
I mean...

178
00:09:58,450 --> 00:10:00,260
How can I let you go to Jinan

179
00:10:00,430 --> 00:10:01,530
all by yourself?

180
00:10:02,500 --> 00:10:03,690
I'm not alone.

181
00:10:03,980 --> 00:10:05,380
Doctor Su will go with me.

182
00:10:05,500 --> 00:10:06,960
With her taking care of me,

183
00:10:07,260 --> 00:10:08,170
I'll be fine.

184
00:10:08,980 --> 00:10:09,710
Don't worry.

185
00:10:13,340 --> 00:10:14,400
But Your Highness,

186
00:10:14,740 --> 00:10:17,050
Doctor Su is only good at medicine.

187
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:19,690
She knows nothing about official affairs.

188
00:10:19,690 --> 00:10:21,550
Jinan is the capital of Shandong.

189
00:10:21,710 --> 00:10:23,810
To deal with those officials,

190
00:10:24,770 --> 00:10:26,570
you need someone like me.

191
00:10:27,980 --> 00:10:28,780
Rectifier Yu,

192
00:10:29,050 --> 00:10:29,860
along the way,

193
00:10:30,020 --> 00:10:31,390
how have you been warning me?

194
00:10:31,390 --> 00:10:33,380
You told me never to reveal my identity
to the officials.

195
00:10:33,380 --> 00:10:34,140
But now,

196
00:10:34,380 --> 00:10:35,980
why are you contradicting yourself?

197
00:10:35,980 --> 00:10:37,310
Have you lost your mind?

198
00:10:38,450 --> 00:10:40,050
I apologize, Your Highness.

199
00:10:46,260 --> 00:10:46,860
This is...

200
00:10:49,310 --> 00:10:51,620
If my uncle sees this letter,

201
00:10:51,900 --> 00:10:53,450
he will definitely understand.

202
00:10:53,450 --> 00:10:54,170
Remember.

203
00:10:54,670 --> 00:10:55,500
This letter

204
00:10:56,070 --> 00:10:57,800
can only be shown to Zhang Quan.

205
00:11:04,290 --> 00:11:05,260
This journey

206
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:09,260
will surely be perilous.

207
00:11:10,380 --> 00:11:12,440
Fortunately, no one knows your face.

208
00:11:14,570 --> 00:11:15,770
But mark my words.

209
00:11:17,100 --> 00:11:18,530
You must stay alive.

210
00:11:20,220 --> 00:11:21,620
When I enter the capital,

211
00:11:22,270 --> 00:11:23,670
we will meet

212
00:11:24,760 --> 00:11:26,560
at the tavern in Rongxian Alley.

213
00:11:27,100 --> 00:11:27,860
Got it?

214
00:11:33,070 --> 00:11:34,730
The tavern in Rongxian Alley.

215
00:11:37,970 --> 00:11:38,870
I got it.

216
00:11:43,270 --> 00:11:44,260
Along the way,

217
00:11:44,690 --> 00:11:46,690
I've been hitting and scolding you.

218
00:11:46,860 --> 00:11:47,650
I hope you

219
00:11:48,340 --> 00:11:49,600
won't take it to heart.

220
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:53,770
I know very well

221
00:11:54,450 --> 00:11:55,710
that your harsh advice

222
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:57,650
was all to protect me.

223
00:12:08,020 --> 00:12:09,620
Now I have no other choice.

224
00:12:10,810 --> 00:12:12,050
On this trip to Jinan,

225
00:12:13,190 --> 00:12:14,950
I have another thing to do.

226
00:12:16,170 --> 00:12:18,300
I'm going to meet an important person.

227
00:12:28,680 --> 00:12:30,810
Could it be related to military power?

228
00:12:50,290 --> 00:12:52,220
After the small encoffining
comes the full encoffining.

229
00:12:52,220 --> 00:12:53,930
The Emperor's body will be moved...

230
00:12:53,930 --> 00:12:55,060
What are they doing?

231
00:12:55,690 --> 00:12:56,490
Your Majesty.

232
00:12:56,570 --> 00:12:58,170
They are preparing the silk.

233
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:04,500
As you said, after His Majesty's body...

234
00:13:05,020 --> 00:13:07,080
After the Emperor's body
is placed in the coffin,

235
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:10,500
an altar must be set up with offerings, a silk memorial,
a spirit tablet, and a funeral banner

236
00:13:10,500 --> 00:13:12,550
for the heir apparent,
the imperial consorts,

237
00:13:12,550 --> 00:13:15,150
and the court officials
to pay their respects.

238
00:13:24,520 --> 00:13:27,340
But the Crown Prince
has yet to return to the capital,

239
00:13:27,340 --> 00:13:30,870
which means the succeeding Emperor
has not yet taken his place.

240
00:13:30,880 --> 00:13:32,410
I believe I, as his mother,

241
00:13:32,810 --> 00:13:36,140
should act on his behalf
at the grand encoffining ceremony.

242
00:13:38,860 --> 00:13:41,390
Sister-in-law,
surely you can't be serious.

243
00:13:41,430 --> 00:13:42,740
The grand encoffining ceremony
and memorial rites

244
00:13:42,740 --> 00:13:44,140
symbolize the succession to the throne.

245
00:13:44,140 --> 00:13:45,150
That is to say,

246
00:13:45,380 --> 00:13:48,020
whoever leads the memorial rites
for the late Emperor

247
00:13:48,020 --> 00:13:50,690
establishes their claim to the throne.

248
00:13:50,900 --> 00:13:51,860
Could it be

249
00:13:52,570 --> 00:13:55,290
you have designs on the throne?

250
00:13:55,620 --> 00:13:57,420
Everyone knows the Crown Prince

251
00:13:57,530 --> 00:13:59,060
is the rightful successor.

252
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:01,770
I'm merely taking care of a few things

253
00:14:02,170 --> 00:14:03,620
on my son's behalf for the time being.

254
00:14:03,620 --> 00:14:05,360
Sister-in-law,
how long exactly do you mean

255
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:06,770
by "the time being"?

256
00:14:07,470 --> 00:14:09,670
What if the Crown Prince
still hasn't returned

257
00:14:09,670 --> 00:14:11,790
by the time the funeral procession departs

258
00:14:11,790 --> 00:14:13,330
for the burial?

259
00:14:13,360 --> 00:14:14,190
Prince of Han.

260
00:14:15,050 --> 00:14:17,310
His Majesty hasn't even been laid to rest.

261
00:14:17,310 --> 00:14:19,130
Aren't you being a little too impatient?

262
00:14:19,130 --> 00:14:21,860
I could say the same about you.

263
00:14:24,340 --> 00:14:26,360
The grand encoffining ceremony
is a matter of state.

264
00:14:26,360 --> 00:14:28,170
My lords,

265
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:30,650
what are your opinions?

266
00:14:30,770 --> 00:14:32,650
Etiquette is never a trivial matter
in our Ming Empire.

267
00:14:32,650 --> 00:14:35,050
For Her Majesty to perform the memorial rites
on the Crown Prince's behalf

268
00:14:35,050 --> 00:14:37,840
[Lord Lyu, Vice Minister of Rites]

269
00:14:35,170 --> 00:14:37,150
would be inappropriate
both in sentiment and in propriety.

270
00:14:37,150 --> 00:14:37,570
Please...

271
00:14:37,570 --> 00:14:38,770
Lord Lyu is wrong!

272
00:14:39,170 --> 00:14:40,840
The Crown Prince
is the succeeding Emperor.

273
00:14:40,840 --> 00:14:42,680
[Liu Sichang, Left Censor-in-Chief]

274
00:14:40,980 --> 00:14:42,930
There should be no deadline
for waiting for him

275
00:14:42,930 --> 00:14:44,100
to lead the memorial rites.

276
00:14:44,100 --> 00:14:45,720
Lord Liu, you make it sound so easy.

277
00:14:45,720 --> 00:14:46,750
If we're to wait,

278
00:14:45,780 --> 00:14:48,510
[Lord Song, Vice Minister of Rites]

279
00:14:46,770 --> 00:14:48,170
there must be a deadline.

280
00:14:48,430 --> 00:14:51,030
I believe
any of His Majesty's close relatives

281
00:14:51,190 --> 00:14:52,860
may lead the memorial rites,

282
00:14:52,930 --> 00:14:54,590
such as the Princes of Yue and Xiang.

283
00:14:54,590 --> 00:14:57,830
Then the Prince of Han
is His Majesty's brother

284
00:14:58,520 --> 00:15:00,810
and the Crown Prince's uncle.

285
00:15:01,570 --> 00:15:03,120
Having him lead the memorial rites

286
00:15:03,120 --> 00:15:04,600
would honor both ritual propriety

287
00:15:04,600 --> 00:15:05,740
and family ties.

288
00:15:06,810 --> 00:15:08,570
Lord Lyu is right.

289
00:15:09,220 --> 00:15:12,480
That's the right thing to do,
both morally and rationally.

290
00:15:17,720 --> 00:15:24,890
[Jinan]

291
00:15:29,320 --> 00:15:32,590
[He Si, Iron Alliance]

292
00:15:29,360 --> 00:15:31,170
Don't put them together when you dye them.

293
00:15:31,170 --> 00:15:32,720
That way, the color will come out evenly.

294
00:15:32,720 --> 00:15:33,290
Okay.

295
00:15:36,680 --> 00:15:40,810
[Dyeing House]

296
00:15:41,960 --> 00:15:46,740
[Iron Alliance Headquarters]

297
00:15:49,310 --> 00:15:49,860
Hurry.

298
00:16:05,310 --> 00:16:07,220
This is the Iron Alliance's headquarters
in Jinan.

299
00:16:07,220 --> 00:16:08,010
It's very safe.

300
00:16:08,010 --> 00:16:09,810
You can stay here without worry.

301
00:16:16,740 --> 00:16:18,540
This is the room prepared for you.

302
00:16:18,540 --> 00:16:20,870
We also brought Hong Yu over from Jinling.

303
00:16:32,380 --> 00:16:32,990
Yulu?

304
00:16:33,050 --> 00:16:33,650
Aunt Hong.

305
00:16:33,770 --> 00:16:34,410
Yulu!

306
00:16:38,810 --> 00:16:40,210
I heard you were injured.

307
00:16:40,950 --> 00:16:42,170
Come on. Careful.

308
00:16:42,400 --> 00:16:42,980
Sit here.

309
00:16:45,400 --> 00:16:46,460
Where are you hurt?

310
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:51,900
Here?

311
00:16:52,900 --> 00:16:53,650
Let me see.

312
00:16:56,290 --> 00:16:57,890
How could it be this serious?

313
00:16:58,190 --> 00:17:00,140
This... This must hurt a lot.

314
00:17:00,380 --> 00:17:02,720
Aunt Hong, I'm much better now.

315
00:17:02,740 --> 00:17:04,000
It doesn't hurt at all.

316
00:17:04,339 --> 00:17:06,339
No, you need to see a doctor for this.

317
00:17:06,369 --> 00:17:08,170
Otherwise, it will leave a scar.

318
00:17:08,490 --> 00:17:10,089
I'll go out and find a doctor.

319
00:17:10,319 --> 00:17:11,910
Let's take her to the clinic
for treatment.

320
00:17:11,910 --> 00:17:12,510
Aunt Hong.

321
00:17:12,950 --> 00:17:14,810
I'll go out and look for one later.

322
00:17:16,210 --> 00:17:17,140
Where else?

323
00:17:17,619 --> 00:17:18,170
Bones?

324
00:17:19,060 --> 00:17:20,619
Nowhere else, Aunt Hong.

325
00:17:21,190 --> 00:17:23,079
I'm perfectly fine everywhere else.

326
00:17:23,079 --> 00:17:23,730
Aunt Hong,

327
00:17:24,579 --> 00:17:25,579
how have you been?

328
00:17:26,140 --> 00:17:27,339
Did those guys from the Iron Alliance

329
00:17:27,339 --> 00:17:28,540
make things difficult for you?

330
00:17:28,540 --> 00:17:30,690
They've been treating me quite well.

331
00:17:31,010 --> 00:17:32,880
Ever since
they took me away from that place,

332
00:17:32,880 --> 00:17:34,410
I've felt much more at ease.

333
00:17:36,340 --> 00:17:38,690
You must be hungry after the long journey.

334
00:17:39,970 --> 00:17:40,580
Yes.

335
00:17:42,490 --> 00:17:44,080
Then let's have some wontons.

336
00:17:44,080 --> 00:17:44,690
Sure.

337
00:17:45,750 --> 00:17:47,780
Let's have Yulu's favorite,

338
00:17:47,950 --> 00:17:49,010
the all-meat ones.

339
00:17:49,060 --> 00:17:50,930
My favorite?

340
00:17:51,690 --> 00:17:53,140
That's your favorite.

341
00:18:00,800 --> 00:18:02,840
They taste the same
as the ones in Jinling, Dingyuan.

342
00:18:02,840 --> 00:18:05,060
They taste exactly like the ones we had

343
00:18:05,190 --> 00:18:07,600
at the wonton stall
Father used to take us to in Jinling.

344
00:18:07,600 --> 00:18:08,530
Do you remember?

345
00:18:08,860 --> 00:18:10,100
One year when you were on duty,

346
00:18:10,100 --> 00:18:11,150
it was freezing cold.

347
00:18:11,150 --> 00:18:12,320
Father braved the rain

348
00:18:12,320 --> 00:18:13,580
to buy you a bowl of hot wontons

349
00:18:13,580 --> 00:18:14,900
and deliver it to the yamen.

350
00:18:14,900 --> 00:18:17,380
He came home so cold that he was delirious

351
00:18:17,580 --> 00:18:19,440
and spent 3 whole days bedridden.

352
00:18:19,620 --> 00:18:20,250
How could I

353
00:18:20,650 --> 00:18:21,650
ever forget that?

354
00:18:22,820 --> 00:18:23,880
And what about you?

355
00:18:23,950 --> 00:18:26,490
That time you had a high fever
in the middle of the night,

356
00:18:26,490 --> 00:18:28,890
Father carried you on his back
for 4 streets

357
00:18:28,970 --> 00:18:30,770
and finally broke into a clinic.

358
00:18:31,100 --> 00:18:32,030
When he got home,

359
00:18:32,340 --> 00:18:33,870
he had lost one of his shoes,

360
00:18:33,930 --> 00:18:36,190
and his trouser legs were covered in mud.

361
00:18:39,540 --> 00:18:40,340
Actually,

362
00:18:40,370 --> 00:18:42,500
he always cared about you two the most.

363
00:18:42,730 --> 00:18:43,860
If he knew

364
00:18:44,060 --> 00:18:45,650
that you two had reunited,

365
00:18:46,260 --> 00:18:47,450
he would be at peace.

366
00:18:56,560 --> 00:18:57,690
Dingyuan, Yulu.

367
00:18:58,950 --> 00:19:01,170
Jinling City is too dangerous.

368
00:19:01,800 --> 00:19:03,170
We shouldn't stay here any longer.

369
00:19:03,170 --> 00:19:04,820
We'd better get out of here

370
00:19:04,920 --> 00:19:06,050
as soon as possible.

371
00:19:09,690 --> 00:19:10,260
Father.

372
00:19:10,970 --> 00:19:12,820
What does it matter to our family

373
00:19:13,510 --> 00:19:15,670
whether Jinling City is dangerous or not?

374
00:19:15,670 --> 00:19:16,410
You go.

375
00:19:16,710 --> 00:19:18,110
Yulu and I will stay here.

376
00:19:18,630 --> 00:19:19,560
I'm not leaving.

377
00:19:21,210 --> 00:19:23,860
I'm the one
who makes the decisions in this family.

378
00:19:23,860 --> 00:19:25,360
Hurry up and pack your things.

379
00:19:25,360 --> 00:19:26,160
The three of us

380
00:19:26,250 --> 00:19:28,580
are leaving Jinling
in the next day or two.

381
00:19:35,490 --> 00:19:36,100
Aunt Hong.

382
00:19:37,100 --> 00:19:39,410
Do you know why

383
00:19:39,800 --> 00:19:41,930
the Iron Alliance went to such lengths

384
00:19:42,340 --> 00:19:43,470
to bring me to Jinan?

385
00:19:47,360 --> 00:19:49,010
It's a long story.

386
00:19:49,690 --> 00:19:51,820
Right now, the most important thing is

387
00:19:51,910 --> 00:19:52,970
to eat the wontons.

388
00:19:53,250 --> 00:19:55,380
We'll talk after you've had your fill.

389
00:19:57,100 --> 00:19:57,650
Alright.

390
00:20:12,840 --> 00:20:15,750
[In Memory of Zhong Eryong,
Subject of the Ming Empire]

391
00:20:16,100 --> 00:20:17,170
Actually, even before you came,

392
00:20:17,170 --> 00:20:18,380
I'd been thinking

393
00:20:18,650 --> 00:20:20,580
that if I never got to see you again,

394
00:20:21,410 --> 00:20:22,670
I'd definitely regret

395
00:20:23,040 --> 00:20:24,500
not telling you the truth.

396
00:20:27,120 --> 00:20:28,730
If I kept it from you,

397
00:20:29,620 --> 00:20:31,010
I'd be betraying

398
00:20:31,340 --> 00:20:32,400
your birth father.

399
00:20:33,990 --> 00:20:34,990
My former master,

400
00:20:35,780 --> 00:20:36,900
Tie Xuan,

401
00:20:37,730 --> 00:20:39,340
was your birth father.

402
00:20:44,720 --> 00:20:47,980
[In Memory of Tie Xuan,
Minister of War of the Ming Empire]

403
00:20:48,430 --> 00:20:49,930
Your real name is...

404
00:20:51,230 --> 00:20:52,410
Tie Fuyuan.

405
00:20:58,280 --> 00:20:59,140
Do you remember

406
00:20:59,410 --> 00:21:01,670
this scar on my hand
I once told you about?

407
00:21:03,370 --> 00:21:03,970
I do.

408
00:21:05,900 --> 00:21:07,650
You told me you got it

409
00:21:07,930 --> 00:21:09,430
when you were at Fule Brothel.

410
00:21:09,430 --> 00:21:11,690
You got this scar at the same time

411
00:21:12,010 --> 00:21:13,940
as you got the one on your right leg.

412
00:21:14,060 --> 00:21:15,820
Keep Fuyuan alive!

413
00:21:17,380 --> 00:21:18,170
Retreat!

414
00:21:18,540 --> 00:21:19,450
Retreat now!

415
00:21:19,230 --> 00:21:21,300
[Tie Xuan]

416
00:21:36,710 --> 00:21:38,810
[Young Wu Dingyuan]

417
00:21:57,250 --> 00:21:59,510
Actually, Wu Buping and I always thought

418
00:21:59,950 --> 00:22:01,400
it was better that you forgot

419
00:22:01,400 --> 00:22:02,800
what happened back then.

420
00:22:03,970 --> 00:22:06,250
There'd be nothing wrong with you

421
00:22:07,210 --> 00:22:08,580
spending the rest of your life happily

422
00:22:08,580 --> 00:22:10,510
as a good-for-nothing in Jinling.

423
00:22:11,300 --> 00:22:12,630
At least you'd be alive,

424
00:22:14,300 --> 00:22:16,900
and the Tie family bloodline
would live on.

425
00:22:17,650 --> 00:22:18,140
Here.

426
00:22:19,010 --> 00:22:21,010
Offer incense to your birth father.

427
00:22:49,230 --> 00:22:50,010
Tomorrow

428
00:22:50,640 --> 00:22:52,840
is the anniversary of Tie Xuan's death.

429
00:22:55,750 --> 00:22:57,010
I'll take you to see it.

430
00:23:23,010 --> 00:23:24,340
After Tie Xuan's death,

431
00:23:24,540 --> 00:23:26,650
every year on the anniversary,
the people of Jinan

432
00:23:26,650 --> 00:23:28,250
would gather by Daming Lake,

433
00:23:29,300 --> 00:23:31,300
stick half-length willow branches

434
00:23:31,350 --> 00:23:32,190
into the ground

435
00:23:32,190 --> 00:23:33,580
to serve as makeshift incense sticks,

436
00:23:33,580 --> 00:23:35,710
and then kowtow to pay their respects.

437
00:23:43,900 --> 00:23:46,400
These people are carrying willow branches
up the hill.

438
00:23:46,400 --> 00:23:48,660
They must be heading to Zuying Mountain.

439
00:23:48,740 --> 00:23:51,040
Looks like Rectifier Yu
remembered it wrong.

440
00:23:51,040 --> 00:23:52,760
On such an important day,

441
00:23:53,510 --> 00:23:56,110
people of the Iron Alliance
should be here too.

442
00:23:56,690 --> 00:23:57,890
They certainly will.

443
00:23:58,820 --> 00:24:01,080
Let's follow the crowd up the hill first.

444
00:24:01,410 --> 00:24:02,810
We'll find their people

445
00:24:02,860 --> 00:24:04,390
before we decide what to do.

446
00:24:05,990 --> 00:24:07,250
Let's talk over there.

447
00:24:13,730 --> 00:24:14,930
Even if we find them,

448
00:24:16,100 --> 00:24:18,230
will they tell us where Wu Dingyuan is?

449
00:24:19,150 --> 00:24:21,080
Back in Jinling, the Iron Alliance

450
00:24:21,880 --> 00:24:24,410
joined forces with Zhu Bukha
to try to kill me.

451
00:24:25,540 --> 00:24:27,200
But after we reached Huai'an,

452
00:24:27,670 --> 00:24:30,080
they helped Good-for-Nothing
out of a tight spot.

453
00:24:30,080 --> 00:24:31,710
Something must have happened in between.

454
00:24:31,710 --> 00:24:32,580
So I don't think

455
00:24:32,730 --> 00:24:34,660
they're necessarily our enemies.

456
00:24:35,670 --> 00:24:36,620
Based on that,

457
00:24:36,970 --> 00:24:38,930
I don't think
we'll come back empty-handed.

458
00:24:38,930 --> 00:24:41,060
And what if we can't find them up there?

459
00:24:42,690 --> 00:24:43,900
I have an old friend

460
00:24:44,250 --> 00:24:45,220
in Shandong.

461
00:24:45,450 --> 00:24:46,170
Back then,

462
00:24:47,690 --> 00:24:50,990
we fought side by side
and entrusted our lives to each other.

463
00:24:50,990 --> 00:24:52,450
He may be our greatest ally

464
00:24:53,510 --> 00:24:54,580
on this journey.

465
00:24:58,140 --> 00:24:58,690
Let's go.

466
00:25:43,050 --> 00:25:48,730
[Zhongwu Shrine]

467
00:26:03,320 --> 00:26:04,580
Every year on this day,

468
00:26:05,340 --> 00:26:06,780
the members of the Iron Alliance

469
00:26:06,780 --> 00:26:09,250
gather here under the pretext
of celebrating the birthday

470
00:26:09,250 --> 00:26:10,690
of the Great Emperor Zhenwu,

471
00:26:10,690 --> 00:26:12,350
setting up a temporary shrine

472
00:26:12,730 --> 00:26:14,590
to pay their respects to Tie Xuan.

473
00:26:22,490 --> 00:26:25,820
You two aren't here to pay your respects
to Tie Xuan, are you?

474
00:26:26,010 --> 00:26:26,780
Tie Xuan?

475
00:26:27,120 --> 00:26:29,780
We're here
to worship the Great Emperor Zhenwu.

476
00:26:31,120 --> 00:26:32,650
Those who worship the Great Emperor Zhenwu

477
00:26:32,650 --> 00:26:34,280
are wealthy families from the city.

478
00:26:34,280 --> 00:26:36,010
They pray for prosperity.

479
00:26:36,540 --> 00:26:38,860
They offer incense
at Zhongwu Shrine on the 3rd day

480
00:26:38,860 --> 00:26:40,920
of the 3rd lunar month, his birthday.

481
00:26:41,430 --> 00:26:42,910
They wouldn't come all the way

482
00:26:42,910 --> 00:26:46,260
to this desolate hillside empty-handed
like you two.

483
00:26:47,170 --> 00:26:48,250
We were in a hurry today

484
00:26:48,250 --> 00:26:49,980
and forgot to bring offerings.

485
00:26:51,100 --> 00:26:52,580
Everyone in the city knows

486
00:26:53,010 --> 00:26:54,380
you must bring willow branches

487
00:26:54,380 --> 00:26:56,150
to pay your respects to Tie Xuan.

488
00:26:56,150 --> 00:26:57,640
Even if you two came in a hurry,

489
00:26:57,640 --> 00:26:59,450
surely you know that much?

490
00:27:01,360 --> 00:27:02,060
Ma'am.

491
00:27:03,690 --> 00:27:05,420
Do you also believe in Tie Xuan?

492
00:27:07,490 --> 00:27:10,340
It's the thought that counts.

493
00:27:11,100 --> 00:27:14,060
Tie Xuan always had the common people
in mind, even in his darkest hour.

494
00:27:14,060 --> 00:27:15,580
And he died for us.

495
00:27:16,490 --> 00:27:18,820
There's nothing much we can do.

496
00:27:19,410 --> 00:27:22,140
We can only come here every year
to offer incense,

497
00:27:22,210 --> 00:27:24,780
so his memory won't fade.

498
00:27:25,780 --> 00:27:26,970
But as far as I know,

499
00:27:27,880 --> 00:27:28,650
Tie Xuan

500
00:27:29,060 --> 00:27:31,450
openly opposed Emperor Taizong back then.

501
00:27:31,450 --> 00:27:34,100
And now the Iron Alliance
is using his name

502
00:27:34,320 --> 00:27:35,540
to repeatedly oppose

503
00:27:35,800 --> 00:27:36,930
the imperial court.

504
00:27:38,690 --> 00:27:40,410
What do the affairs of the court

505
00:27:40,410 --> 00:27:42,820
have to do with ordinary folk like us?

506
00:27:43,450 --> 00:27:44,970
All we care about

507
00:27:45,300 --> 00:27:46,990
is having enough to eat every day

508
00:27:46,990 --> 00:27:49,540
and remembering
those who showed us kindness.

509
00:27:49,540 --> 00:27:50,930
For every person one saves,

510
00:27:50,930 --> 00:27:52,820
we add another lump of clay to the pile.

511
00:27:52,820 --> 00:27:54,450
Save hundreds or thousands,

512
00:27:54,860 --> 00:27:56,210
and people will surely use that clay

513
00:27:56,210 --> 00:27:58,610
to sculpt a towering statue
in one's honor.

514
00:27:59,640 --> 00:28:01,650
Does that make someone

515
00:28:01,860 --> 00:28:03,730
who stands for justice a rebel?

516
00:28:04,640 --> 00:28:06,930
No matter who sits on the throne,

517
00:28:07,300 --> 00:28:08,210
we still wake up

518
00:28:08,380 --> 00:28:10,010
to chop wood

519
00:28:10,170 --> 00:28:11,690
and work until night.

520
00:28:12,540 --> 00:28:15,450
If someone could truly ease our hardships

521
00:28:15,650 --> 00:28:18,730
and give ordinary people a better life,

522
00:28:19,060 --> 00:28:22,490
who would want to stir up trouble?

523
00:28:27,690 --> 00:28:30,450
If you two wish to worship
the Great Emperor Zhenwu,

524
00:28:30,450 --> 00:28:32,060
follow this path down

525
00:28:32,310 --> 00:28:34,370
and you'll reach the Zhongwu Shrine.

526
00:28:35,650 --> 00:28:36,240
Thank you.

527
00:28:36,240 --> 00:28:37,240
Thank you, ma'am.

528
00:28:48,900 --> 00:28:49,580
Granny.

529
00:28:52,520 --> 00:28:56,770
[Tang Cai'er, Leader of the Iron Alliance]

530
00:28:55,210 --> 00:28:56,670
Where is Young Master Tie?

531
00:28:56,860 --> 00:28:57,590
He's inside.

532
00:29:25,490 --> 00:29:26,490
Young Master Tie.

533
00:29:27,100 --> 00:29:27,860
Hong Yu.

534
00:29:28,410 --> 00:29:29,470
Please have a seat.

535
00:29:36,510 --> 00:29:37,170
Wu Dingyuan,

536
00:29:37,170 --> 00:29:38,970
this is our leader, Tang Cai'er.

537
00:29:39,100 --> 00:29:41,340
She's the one who's been looking for you.

538
00:29:41,340 --> 00:29:42,060
Yes.

539
00:29:42,780 --> 00:29:44,040
You look just like him.

540
00:29:45,540 --> 00:29:47,970
You look exactly like Tie Xuan back then.

541
00:29:50,140 --> 00:29:52,060
Those people enshrined over there

542
00:29:52,060 --> 00:29:53,650
were your father's brothers-in-arms.

543
00:29:53,650 --> 00:29:55,730
They fought and bled alongside him.

544
00:30:00,730 --> 00:30:01,730
Alliance Leader,

545
00:30:02,170 --> 00:30:03,570
you went to great lengths

546
00:30:03,650 --> 00:30:04,820
to bring me to Jinan.

547
00:30:05,100 --> 00:30:06,340
What is it all for?

548
00:30:06,750 --> 00:30:09,780
It's not just to have me
offer incense here, is it?

549
00:30:12,400 --> 00:30:13,450
Do you know

550
00:30:14,640 --> 00:30:17,100
how I became
the leader of the Iron Alliance?

551
00:30:19,880 --> 00:30:20,860
I was originally

552
00:30:21,170 --> 00:30:22,690
a farmer's daughter.

553
00:30:23,400 --> 00:30:26,380
In the 17th year of the Yongle reign,
a severe drought hit Shandong.

554
00:30:26,380 --> 00:30:27,170
The men

555
00:30:27,490 --> 00:30:29,490
were all conscripted to dig canals.

556
00:30:29,780 --> 00:30:31,060
With no men to farm the fields,

557
00:30:31,060 --> 00:30:32,820
we couldn't survive.

558
00:30:33,430 --> 00:30:34,650
So I led the women

559
00:30:34,650 --> 00:30:37,250
in helping one another carry water
and work the land.

560
00:30:37,250 --> 00:30:39,510
We were just barely getting by like that.

561
00:30:39,820 --> 00:30:42,350
Unexpectedly,
one day, the riverbank burst,

562
00:30:42,490 --> 00:30:45,250
killing everyone working on the dam.

563
00:30:46,620 --> 00:30:47,580
Alliance Leader,

564
00:30:47,580 --> 00:30:49,620
why are you telling me this?

565
00:30:49,910 --> 00:30:51,570
What does it have to do with me?

566
00:30:53,140 --> 00:30:55,080
The family
of those dead conscripted laborers

567
00:30:55,080 --> 00:30:57,010
should have received a pension.

568
00:30:57,410 --> 00:30:58,690
But when the money reached the county,

569
00:30:58,690 --> 00:31:00,040
someone wanted to embezzle it.

570
00:31:00,040 --> 00:31:01,170
So they framed us,

571
00:31:01,710 --> 00:31:04,770
saying Tie Xuan's old subordinates
intended to rebel.

572
00:31:05,300 --> 00:31:05,960
By doing so,

573
00:31:06,070 --> 00:31:08,130
they didn't need to give us the money.

574
00:31:08,410 --> 00:31:11,940
And they could even make a fortune
by confiscating properties.

575
00:31:14,020 --> 00:31:15,880
The constables came to arrest us.

576
00:31:15,970 --> 00:31:16,970
I cursed them

577
00:31:17,620 --> 00:31:19,510
for doing all kinds of wicked things,

578
00:31:19,510 --> 00:31:21,710
asking if they weren't afraid of karma.

579
00:31:21,800 --> 00:31:22,780
Who would have thought

580
00:31:22,780 --> 00:31:23,640
that constable

581
00:31:23,840 --> 00:31:26,840
would suddenly have a heart attack
and die on the spot?

582
00:31:27,400 --> 00:31:28,860
Someone shouted,

583
00:31:29,060 --> 00:31:30,730
"Tie Xuan has manifested himself!"

584
00:31:30,730 --> 00:31:32,730
That was how the story spread:

585
00:31:33,170 --> 00:31:34,900
Tie Xuan descended to the world

586
00:31:34,900 --> 00:31:37,760
and struck down a corrupt official
with lightning.

587
00:31:38,930 --> 00:31:40,540
You certainly know how to use a situation
to your advantage.

588
00:31:40,540 --> 00:31:41,340
What are you talking about?

589
00:31:41,340 --> 00:31:42,470
What? Can't I say it?

590
00:31:48,450 --> 00:31:49,580
Word spread

591
00:31:49,860 --> 00:31:51,010
far and wide,

592
00:31:51,320 --> 00:31:52,540
and before long,

593
00:31:53,010 --> 00:31:53,930
many of

594
00:31:54,060 --> 00:31:57,320
Tie Xuan's former subordinates
really did come to join us.

595
00:31:57,600 --> 00:31:59,170
We all revered Tie Xuan,

596
00:31:59,990 --> 00:32:03,140
so we founded the Iron Alliance
to worship him,

597
00:32:03,560 --> 00:32:06,020
hoping to give our brothers
a way to survive.

598
00:32:06,990 --> 00:32:07,780
So

599
00:32:09,010 --> 00:32:10,380
you brought me here

600
00:32:11,210 --> 00:32:11,930
because

601
00:32:11,930 --> 00:32:14,170
I'm Tie Xuan's son, is that it?

602
00:32:15,100 --> 00:32:16,060
Exactly.

603
00:32:16,510 --> 00:32:19,210
And what does that have to do
with your Iron Alliance?

604
00:32:19,210 --> 00:32:22,210
Are you trying
to capitalize on Tie Xuan's reputation

605
00:32:22,450 --> 00:32:24,380
and use me to build your influence?

606
00:32:24,400 --> 00:32:25,140
Dingyuan.

607
00:32:30,140 --> 00:32:31,410
We brought you back

608
00:32:32,730 --> 00:32:34,490
because we need you to save us.

609
00:32:36,690 --> 00:32:38,900
Your Iron Alliance is so powerful.

610
00:32:39,120 --> 00:32:41,970
You even dared
to plot the Crown Prince's assassination.

611
00:32:41,970 --> 00:32:44,690
I'm just a little constable
of Yingtian Prefectural Office.

612
00:32:44,690 --> 00:32:46,780
How could I possibly save you?

613
00:32:46,970 --> 00:32:47,820
Besides,

614
00:32:48,280 --> 00:32:49,940
one minute you want to kill me,

615
00:32:50,170 --> 00:32:51,700
the next you want to save me,

616
00:32:51,710 --> 00:32:53,860
and now you want me to save you.

617
00:32:55,210 --> 00:32:56,010
I don't get it.

618
00:32:56,670 --> 00:32:58,270
Come on, Aunt Hong. Let's go.

619
00:32:59,170 --> 00:32:59,770
Dingyuan,

620
00:33:00,010 --> 00:33:00,970
don't be hasty.

621
00:33:01,450 --> 00:33:02,780
Hear Granny out first.

622
00:33:03,510 --> 00:33:05,190
We've saved you so many times.

623
00:33:05,540 --> 00:33:07,140
Have you no conscience?

624
00:33:14,060 --> 00:33:17,450
We've been relentlessly hunted
by the authorities in Shandong.

625
00:33:17,450 --> 00:33:18,650
To survive,

626
00:33:19,080 --> 00:33:20,930
we had no choice
but to make a deal with the Prince of Han

627
00:33:20,930 --> 00:33:23,620
and arrange for the Crown Prince
to be killed in Jinling.

628
00:33:23,620 --> 00:33:25,380
But once we learned who you really were,

629
00:33:25,380 --> 00:33:26,170
we had no choice

630
00:33:26,170 --> 00:33:29,010
but to betray the Prince of Han
and protect you.

631
00:33:29,840 --> 00:33:30,490
I see.

632
00:33:31,900 --> 00:33:33,230
Then let me ask you this:

633
00:33:34,900 --> 00:33:36,780
My adoptive father, Wu Buping,

634
00:33:37,410 --> 00:33:38,620
died because of this.

635
00:33:39,840 --> 00:33:42,100
How do you intend to answer for his death?

636
00:33:56,100 --> 00:33:56,900
Kill me.

637
00:33:57,640 --> 00:33:58,840
Would that be enough?

638
00:34:01,880 --> 00:34:04,210
-You think I dare not kill you?
-Dingyuan.

639
00:34:08,340 --> 00:34:09,489
A life for a life.

640
00:34:15,290 --> 00:34:17,570
What good would it do if I killed you?

641
00:34:20,250 --> 00:34:21,780
Can it bring my father back?

642
00:34:24,010 --> 00:34:25,530
With so many people going up the mountain

643
00:34:25,530 --> 00:34:27,080
and the Iron Alliance
hiding among the commoners,

644
00:34:27,080 --> 00:34:28,679
how are we going to find them?

645
00:34:33,929 --> 00:34:34,530
Loose!

646
00:34:37,130 --> 00:34:37,989
Run, everyone!

647
00:34:38,340 --> 00:34:38,929
Run!

648
00:34:45,900 --> 00:34:46,449
This way!

649
00:35:15,700 --> 00:35:16,300
Stop!

650
00:35:36,090 --> 00:35:37,180
Judging by their uniforms,

651
00:35:37,180 --> 00:35:39,180
they must be soldiers
from the Shandong Guard.

652
00:35:39,180 --> 00:35:41,640
Why are they suddenly
raiding the mountain?

653
00:35:43,900 --> 00:35:45,900
Slaughtering civilians wantonly.

654
00:35:46,260 --> 00:35:47,490
This is outrageous.

655
00:35:48,160 --> 00:35:49,840
Jin Rong has been hunting down

656
00:35:50,360 --> 00:35:52,200
the Iron Alliance in Shandong for ages,

657
00:35:52,200 --> 00:35:52,930
but now

658
00:35:53,200 --> 00:35:54,680
he's even going after commoners.

659
00:35:54,680 --> 00:35:55,760
I can't just stand by and watch.

660
00:35:55,760 --> 00:35:57,450
Your Highness,
there are just too many of them.

661
00:35:57,450 --> 00:35:58,650
We must leave at once!

662
00:35:59,900 --> 00:36:00,660
Doctor Su,

663
00:36:01,470 --> 00:36:03,530
knowing Jin Rong's way of waging war,

664
00:36:03,700 --> 00:36:04,570
these people

665
00:36:05,050 --> 00:36:06,530
will all be slaughtered

666
00:36:07,740 --> 00:36:08,570
unless

667
00:36:08,880 --> 00:36:10,050
someone can make him stop.

668
00:36:10,050 --> 00:36:11,250
Who can make him stop?

669
00:36:11,630 --> 00:36:12,260
I can.

670
00:36:13,260 --> 00:36:14,590
If I reveal my identity,

671
00:36:15,360 --> 00:36:16,360
he can't possibly

672
00:36:16,970 --> 00:36:18,260
have no scruples.

673
00:36:19,760 --> 00:36:21,290
We were brothers-in-arms.

674
00:36:21,320 --> 00:36:22,380
I'll go talk to him.

675
00:36:22,590 --> 00:36:24,320
You go find Good-for-Nothing.

676
00:36:25,050 --> 00:36:26,650
Your Highness, you mustn't.

677
00:36:26,780 --> 00:36:28,720
If Jin Rong harbors evil intentions

678
00:36:28,720 --> 00:36:29,900
and captures you,

679
00:36:30,150 --> 00:36:32,000
neither you nor these people

680
00:36:32,180 --> 00:36:33,160
will survive.

681
00:36:37,450 --> 00:36:38,450
I still have to go.

682
00:36:52,230 --> 00:36:52,970
Loose!

683
00:37:05,610 --> 00:37:06,260
He Si!

684
00:37:07,180 --> 00:37:08,220
Protect the Leader.

685
00:37:08,220 --> 00:37:08,740
Okay.

686
00:37:09,700 --> 00:37:10,760
I'll go take a look.

687
00:37:13,820 --> 00:37:14,530
Stop!

688
00:37:29,050 --> 00:37:29,780
Who are they?

689
00:37:30,970 --> 00:37:32,780
Judging by their uniforms,
they're from the Shandong Guard,

690
00:37:32,780 --> 00:37:34,710
working for that bastard Jin Rong.

691
00:37:42,530 --> 00:37:43,700
Father!

692
00:37:46,380 --> 00:37:47,570
Mother!

693
00:37:49,660 --> 00:37:50,740
Father!

694
00:37:51,240 --> 00:37:52,260
Father!

695
00:37:53,570 --> 00:37:54,490
Mother!

696
00:38:08,740 --> 00:38:09,900
Kid, hurry!

697
00:38:25,990 --> 00:38:26,860
Get in!

698
00:38:27,850 --> 00:38:28,420
Hurry!

699
00:38:35,160 --> 00:38:35,820
Leader,

700
00:38:36,320 --> 00:38:38,450
we'd better get down the mountain now.

701
00:38:39,400 --> 00:38:41,660
Take Lord Tie's memorial tablet with us.

702
00:38:48,430 --> 00:38:49,290
Your Highness!

703
00:38:49,910 --> 00:38:51,400
Your Highness, please think this through!

704
00:38:51,400 --> 00:38:52,510
-You can't go!
-No time to lose!

705
00:38:52,510 --> 00:38:53,450
Let's split up.

706
00:38:53,860 --> 00:38:55,050
I'll draw their attention.

707
00:38:55,050 --> 00:38:56,380
You go find Good-for-Nothing.

708
00:38:56,380 --> 00:38:57,640
This is not a good idea!

709
00:38:57,840 --> 00:38:58,840
There's nothing wrong with it!

710
00:38:58,840 --> 00:39:00,700
Don't worry about me! Be careful!

711
00:39:11,840 --> 00:39:12,780
We've received intelligence

712
00:39:12,780 --> 00:39:14,360
that the Iron Alliance is gathering here
to plot a rebellion.

713
00:39:14,360 --> 00:39:15,380
General Jin has ordered

714
00:39:15,380 --> 00:39:16,450
that every last one of them be killed.

715
00:39:16,450 --> 00:39:17,380
Where is Jin Si?

716
00:39:17,680 --> 00:39:18,800
Tell him to get out here!

717
00:39:18,800 --> 00:39:20,330
Who's this hotheaded fool?

718
00:39:21,900 --> 00:39:22,820
Bastards!

719
00:39:23,300 --> 00:39:24,900
I am the Crown Prince of the Ming Empire!

720
00:39:24,900 --> 00:39:25,760
Where is Jin Si?

721
00:39:26,050 --> 00:39:27,380
Tell him to get out here!

722
00:39:28,260 --> 00:39:28,900
Speak!

723
00:39:30,160 --> 00:39:31,960
Young Master, this way, please.

724
00:39:41,670 --> 00:39:45,840
[Jin's Mansion]

725
00:39:44,570 --> 00:39:46,030
Tell Jin Si to get out here!

726
00:39:49,530 --> 00:39:50,180
Tie him up!

727
00:39:57,130 --> 00:40:01,110
[Jin Rong,
Regional Military Commander of Shandong]

728
00:40:13,380 --> 00:40:13,930
General,

729
00:40:14,160 --> 00:40:17,160
we've captured an Iron Alliance member
who claims to be the Crown Prince.

730
00:40:17,160 --> 00:40:17,700
I...

731
00:40:29,050 --> 00:40:29,760
Gree—

732
00:40:31,840 --> 00:40:33,470
Greetings, Your Highness.

733
00:40:33,940 --> 00:40:36,170
Jin Si, long time no see.

734
00:40:37,300 --> 00:40:38,200
Your Highness...

735
00:40:38,200 --> 00:40:38,660
Rise.

736
00:40:38,660 --> 00:40:39,130
Well...

737
00:40:39,880 --> 00:40:41,900
My soldiers are rather ignorant.

738
00:40:42,510 --> 00:40:43,180
Besides,

739
00:40:43,450 --> 00:40:44,680
no one would ever expect

740
00:40:44,680 --> 00:40:47,610
to run into the Crown Prince here
on Zuying Mountain.

741
00:40:48,990 --> 00:40:50,780
You call me "Your Highness,"

742
00:40:51,200 --> 00:40:53,000
yet you keep me tied up like this?

743
00:40:53,860 --> 00:40:55,790
Your Highness, please forgive me.

744
00:40:57,220 --> 00:40:58,750
Forgive me, Your Highness.

745
00:41:05,820 --> 00:41:06,680
Your Highness.

746
00:41:07,220 --> 00:41:08,030
-Please have a seat.
-General.

747
00:41:08,030 --> 00:41:09,450
We've finished clearing the mountain.

748
00:41:09,450 --> 00:41:11,450
We killed quite a few,
but many also escaped.

749
00:41:11,450 --> 00:41:12,490
It's just that

750
00:41:12,800 --> 00:41:14,880
the leader wasn't that old hag,
Tang Cai'er.

751
00:41:14,880 --> 00:41:15,740
Then who was it?

752
00:41:16,180 --> 00:41:16,900
It was a man,

753
00:41:17,010 --> 00:41:17,760
quite young.

754
00:41:17,970 --> 00:41:20,370
The rebels called him... Young Master Tie.

755
00:41:20,570 --> 00:41:21,900
Did you leave any alive?

756
00:41:22,070 --> 00:41:22,610
Yes.

757
00:41:22,800 --> 00:41:24,530
We caught 2 Iron Alliance members.

758
00:41:24,530 --> 00:41:25,570
Bring them in at once.

759
00:41:25,570 --> 00:41:26,090
Yes!

760
00:41:29,530 --> 00:41:30,390
Your Highness,

761
00:41:31,070 --> 00:41:31,700
you...

762
00:41:33,410 --> 00:41:34,210
Bring them in!

763
00:41:40,400 --> 00:41:40,970
Kneel!

764
00:41:48,530 --> 00:41:49,460
All these years,

765
00:41:50,050 --> 00:41:52,850
I've allowed you some latitude
in your activities

766
00:41:52,950 --> 00:41:54,260
in Shandong.

767
00:41:56,090 --> 00:41:57,350
Haven't your soldiers

768
00:41:57,550 --> 00:41:58,380
shed enough of

769
00:41:58,820 --> 00:42:01,900
our Iron Alliance brothers' blood
over the years?

770
00:42:02,740 --> 00:42:03,840
If you'd just stayed in line,

771
00:42:03,840 --> 00:42:05,640
none of this would've happened.

772
00:42:06,070 --> 00:42:07,200
If you surrender now

773
00:42:07,660 --> 00:42:09,120
and hand over your leader,

774
00:42:09,340 --> 00:42:10,550
you'll still be punished,

775
00:42:10,550 --> 00:42:12,810
but at least you'll be spared execution.

776
00:42:14,260 --> 00:42:15,530
Surrender?

777
00:42:17,840 --> 00:42:19,050
In your dreams!

778
00:42:24,550 --> 00:42:25,220
Jin Si!

779
00:42:33,360 --> 00:42:34,220
Jin Si,

780
00:42:35,010 --> 00:42:37,470
even if they're guilty beyond forgiveness,

781
00:42:37,490 --> 00:42:39,410
you can't just execute them all.

782
00:42:41,680 --> 00:42:42,780
These are living,

783
00:42:43,300 --> 00:42:44,860
breathing human beings.

784
00:42:48,130 --> 00:42:49,700
Your Highness, I'm sorry for the fright.

785
00:42:49,700 --> 00:42:50,700
It's just that...

786
00:42:52,610 --> 00:42:53,410
What?

787
00:42:53,710 --> 00:42:55,440
It's just that some lessons...

788
00:42:56,950 --> 00:42:58,630
can only be taught in blood.

789
00:43:00,160 --> 00:43:01,900
Quite the display of power.

790
00:43:04,090 --> 00:43:05,130
You're too kind, Your Highness.
